eds and purples of the berries contrast beautifully against the cake's soft, snowy white topping."], "This image puts food and its ingredients together. It looks like a menu, with the main body of the food listed together with the food ingredients. The food is in the center of the image, and the ingredients are distributed around the image. The food ingredients are its background, and each ingredient image is connected to the main dish with a thin line.Each ingredient image is connected to the main dish with a thin line，This adorable strawberry cake showcases the following ingredients:\n\n1. **Strawberries**: Fresh, plump red strawberries with vibrant green leaves.  \n2. **Whipped Cream**: Smooth, fluffy white frosting forming decorations.  \n3. **White Chocolate Hearts**: Sweet, creamy edible heart-shaped toppers.  \n4. **Pink Chocolate Hearts**: Delightful pastel pink hearts for charm.  \n5. **Pink Drizzle Glaze**: A silky pink drip cascading down the sides.  \n6. **Small Sugar Flowers**: Delicate white edible flowers adding elegance.  \n7. **Vanilla Sponge Cake**: Layers of light, golden cake beneath the decorations.AsirFreshflux,This is a round cake with smooth white frosting and pink drip icing cascading down the sides. It is topped with fresh strawberries, white and pink chocolate hearts, tiny white flower decorations, silver sugar pearls, and a ring of piped whipped cream along the top edge.1qqq,infographic design,"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 48, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335533", "size": [457.71209716796875, 535.3479614257812], "pos": [-3860, 910], "id": 42, "locked": true, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 33}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [45], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING"}], "color": "#476947", "widgets_values": [["This image shows a two-layered sponge cake generously 